  "description": "Provides structured error handling primitives, exception wrappers, and result type utilities used across the OASIS and HoloNET ecosystems. Enables consistent error propagation, structured logging of exceptions, and the OASISResult pattern for clean, null-safe async API responses. Part of the OASIS Omniverse ecosystem at https://oasisomniverse.one -- Source: https://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/NextGenSoftware-Libraries",
